{BOX()}
!! cmavo: ji'a (UI3b)
!!! Proposed Definition
Discursive.  Used to indicate an additional case or additional cases.
!!! Proposed Keywords
* also
* too
* additionally
* in addition
* as well
* moreover
* furthermore
* to boot
* even

!!! See Also
* jmina

!!! Usage Examples
; lo plise cu xamgu lo nu kanro .i ji'a py. kukte : ''Apples are good for your health, and, in addition, they taste great.''

; mi ji'a nelci lo plise : ''I too like apples.''

; lo xagji cribe cu citka lo cinki ku ji'a sai : ''A hungry bear will eat even insects.''
{BOX}

{BOX()}
!! cmavo: ku'i (UI3b)
!!! Proposed Definition
Discursive.  Used to indicate a contrasting case or contrasting cases.
!!! Proposed Keywords
* however
* but
* in contrast

!!! See Also
* karbi
* dukti
* nalpanra

!!! Usage Examples
; mi ca cliva .i ku'i mi ba za xruti : ''I'm leaving now, but I'll be back in a while.''
{BOX}

{BOX()}
!! cmavo: mi'u (UI3b)
!!! Proposed Definition
Discursive.  Used to indicate the same case or cases.
!!! Proposed Keywords
* ditto
* the very
* himself
* herself
* itself
* themselves

!!! See Also
* mintu

!!! Usage Examples
; mi pu zi co'a cusku di'u mi'u la .djan. : ''I was just saying the very same thing to John.''
{BOX}

{BOX()}
!! cmavo: mi'u nai (UI3b)
!!! Proposed Definition
Discursive.  Used to indicate another case or other cases.
!!! Proposed Keywords
* another

!!! See Also
* drata

!!! Usage Examples
; mi pu lebna lo cukta la .djan. gi'e dunda cy. mi'u nai la .djein. : I took a book from John and gave another one to Jane. 
{BOX}

{BOX()}
!! cmavo: po'o (UI3b)
!!! Proposed Definition
Discursive.  Used to indicate the only relevant case or cases.
!!! Proposed Keywords
* only
* just
* merely

!!! See Also
* pamei
* mulno
* frica

!!! Usage Examples
; mi pu tcidu le pamoi po'o xe fanva : ''I read only the first translation.''

; mi troci lo nu daspo lo dacti se pi'o le mi menli ku po'o : ''I try to destroy an object using just my mind.''

; po'o lo pavyseljirna na zasti : ''The only thing is, unicorns don't exist.''
{BOX}

{BOX()}
!! cmavo: si'a (UI3b)
!!! Proposed Definition
Discursive.  Used to indicate a similar case or similar cases.
!!! Proposed Keywords
* similarly
* analogously

!!! See Also
* simsa
* panra

!!! Usage Examples
; ka'u mi zmajbi lo smani lo ratcu .i si'a lo mlatu jo'u lo gerku cu zmajbi vo'a lo bakni jo'u lo xarju : ''We know that we are closer to monkeys than to rodents. Similarly cats and dogs are closer to one another than to cows or pigs.''
{BOX}

!!! Notes
Add {po'o nai} ("among others") and {po'o cu'i} ("for one", "not excluding others").

